{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/THEPARTEN00.png?t=1745746841\" />\u300aFlan's BN\u300bis the prequel to \u300aFlan's MS\u300b, which combines JRPG and deckbuilder mechanics. Experience Flan's story of self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/THEPARTEN02.png?t=1745746841\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It all happened\u00a0before\u00a0the Scarlet Mist Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The\u00a0girl\u00a0came\u00a0in\u00a0and\u00a0out\u00a0of\u00a0library\u00a0in\u00a0her\u00a0activity\u00a0time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She had read countless books over hundreds of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Recently\u00a0,\u00a0she\u00a0came\u00a0up\u00a0with\u00a0a\u00a0question,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Who am 'I' ?&quot;,\u00a0she\u00a0asked\u00a0herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With\u00a0this\u00a0question,\u00a0she\u00a0decided\u00a0to\u00a0write\u00a0a\u00a0story\u00a0about\u00a0herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe she will find the answer\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/THEPARTEN03.png?t=1745746841\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has four chapters and playthrough time of more than five hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay consists of two parts: Activity Time and Bedtime Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Activity Time:</strong> <br>Every night, you can explore Scarlet Devil Mansion. Try to find new books, friends and special cards. Also, you may have a chance to uncover the hidden truth of this mystery vampire mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bedtime Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inside the worlds of each book, you can meet different friends, choose your cards freely for battles and experience amazing stories with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/THEPARTEN01.png?t=1745746841\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique\u00a0pixel\u00a0art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build\u00a0your\u00a0team\u00a0and\u00a0card\u00a0deck\u00a0freely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free\u00a0exploration\u00a0of\u00a0Scarlet Devil Mansion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Entertaining\u00a0adaptations\u00a0of\u00a0classic\u00a0literature\u00a0works</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3363040?t=1745746841","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3363040?t=1745746841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/cdccce2eed37175801f9488428fd1536fd68ccd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745746841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/cdccce2eed37175801f9488428fd1536fd68ccd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745746841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363040/extras/THEPARTEN00.png?t=1745746841\" />\u300aFlan's BN\u300bis the prequel to \u300aFlan's MS\u300b, which combines JRPG and deckbuilder mechanics. Experience Flan's story of self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st